nof order for a while.\\rBut the traps are back up and\\nrunning now!\\fWhy lucky, you may ask...\\rBecause you can train yourself better\\nthat way!\\rMake up your mind and go for Lt. Surge!","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00007":"Whew! That was an electrifying bout!\\nIt sure made my nerves tingle.","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00008":"Nope! Nothing here but trash.","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00009":"...\\nOh, you found a secret switch at the\\fbottom of the trash can!\\fBetter press it.","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00010":"Nope! Nothing here but trash.\\nOh no, the electric fence is\\flocked again!","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00011":"The first electric fence is unlocked!","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00012":"The second electric fence is unlocked!\\rNow the electric fences are gone, and\\nthe path to the Leader is clear!","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00013":"Vermilion City Pokémon Gym","msg_0485_T06GYM0101_00014":"Vermilion City Pokémon Gym\\rGym Leader: Lt. Surge\\nCertified Trainer!\\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_021 + 1","OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_022 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_013":13,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_014":14,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_015":15,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_016":16,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_017":17,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_018":18,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_019":19,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_020":20,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_021":21,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_022":22,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_023":23,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_024":24,"_EV_scr_seq_T06GYM0101_025":25,"obj_T06GYM0101_stop":0,"obj_T06GYM0101_stop_2":1,"obj_T06GYM0101_s